   "name": "The Vision and Scarlet Witch (Marvel only)",
   "notes": [
    "24 swaps: the 21 nonland cards and 3 lands with no Marvel printing come out; three Mountains replace the lands.",
    "What it loses: the creatures that ping per spell (Guttersnipe, Firebrand Archer, Kessig Flamebreather, Electrostatic Field, Thermo-Alchemist) and the cheap exile-and-play spells. It wins more by commander damage and less by pinging.",
    "What replaces them: Spider-Verse copies every spell you cast from exile, which Wiccan, Hex Magic and Jessica Jones all provide; Cosmic Cube casts a free spell on each attack; Thor, God of Thunder adds each noncreature spell's mana value as damage; Bionic Blow turns a large commander into a one-shot finisher.",
    "Thor, God of Thunder is one of the contested Thors. If no copy is free, run Franklin Richards, Ascendant.",
    "Avengers Disassembled: use the three-damage mode. Its other mode destroys a land, which is single-target and fine at Bracket 2, but worth a word at the table.",
    "Molten Duplication is the copy from the History of Heroes kit. The token is legendary if it copies the commander, so aim it at Nico Minoru or Wiccan.",
    "Prices (Nov 12 snapshot) for the pieces you may not own: Cosmic Cube $6.77, Winds of Change $3.23, Galvanic Blast $2.20; the rest are under $1.",
    "Not simulated."
   ],
